  "quality_metric": "Records are matched on `incident_id`. Let K be the answer key's records and P the reported records. Comparable cells = 7 * |K|. A cell is matched when the reported record for that incident_id exists and its value equals the key's after normalisation (numbers numerically, strings case-sensitively, booleans identically). Every cell of a key record with no reported counterpart counts as 7 mismatches. Every reported record whose incident_id is not in the key adds 7 to the denominator and contributes 0 matches. quality_score = matched_cells / denominator, rounded to 4 decimal places. `count` disagreeing with the length of `incidents` subtracts 0.05 (floor 0). task_success = true iff quality_score >= 0.97.",
